#: features/sui_stats_menu.lua:89
msgid ""
"When a finished book is deleted from the device (file or folder), keep it counted in the Books Read statistics on the Home Screen.\n"
"\n"
"Books changed back to Reading or Abandoned are automatically removed from this list."
